  "provenance": {"source": "Hand-written example", "notes": ["Sector missions follow the Zones window: a chained GM_Multi mission holding one GM_Undefined mission per sector.", "Each shutter opens only from its sector (trigger kind event), so held open it stays open; a merc presence trigger on it would toggle it shut again. The mercs pass through the hatches beside the shutters.", "Door meshes are placeholders in the map's own HarbD_STM package; import real ones first."]}
